  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership Governance re</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Partnership Governance re</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesian-led initiative established and operated with donor assistance to support and promote reform initiatives on the central and local levels by government and non-government institutions. The main focus areas are electoral and legislative reform; legal and judicial reform; civil service reform and security/police reform with anti-corruption and decentralisation as cross-cutting themes</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Indonesiskt program initierat och finansierat av en grupp givare f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja och fr&#xe4;mja reforminitiativ p&#xe5; central och lokal niv&#xe5; med bl.a. f&#xf6;rvaltningar och civila samh&#xe4;llet som genomf&#xf6;randeparter. De fyra prioriterade omr&#xe5;dena i programmet utg&#xf6;rs av: valsystem och lagstiftning; offentlig f&#xf6;rvaltning, r&#xe4;ttssystemet och s&#xe4;kerhet/polis</narrative>
  </description>
